OL,3,ACOP31 talks at risk of collapse as
OL,4,Apresident says climate deal not
OL,5,Aapproved after fossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe EU and some countries had been
OL,8,Fpushing to restore a commitment to move
OL,9,Faway from fossil fuels after producers
OL,10,Fled by Saudi Arabia called for its
OL,11,Fremoval - the fourth draft still
OL,12,Fcontains no mention of fossil fuels
OL,14,FThe draft acknowledges the goal set by
OL,15,Fthe 2015 Paris Agreement of keeping the
OL,16,Frise in global temperatures below 1.5C
OL,17,Fis going to be missed - as warming goes
OL,18,Fbeyond this the effects of climate
OL,19,Fchange will ramp up significantly
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
