OL,3,ACOP31 talks at risk of collapse as
OL,4,Apresident says climate deal not
OL,5,Aapproved after fossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe summit is already the
OL,8,Flongest-running in history, with
OL,9,Fnegotiations continuing two days after
OL,10,Fit had been due to end - here's a
OL,11,Ftimeline of how we got here
OL,13,FShould countries be unable to reach
OL,14,Fconsensus, negotiations could be
OL,15,Fsuspended until next year, which has
OL,16,Fhappened only once before at a COP
OL,17,Fsummit
